# Delivery & CI/CD

## Pipeline
- Every merge: lint/analyze, unit + integration tests, basic security checks, dependency vulnerability scan (`supply-chain-deps.mdc`). Keep main releasable.
- Build immutable artifacts (container image / package) promoted across envs — no “rebuild for prod”.

## Release
- Prefer canary/blue-green + automated rollback on SLO burn.
- Risky changes behind feature flags; ramp by %/cohort; kill-switch ready.
- Separate deploy from release when possible. Document rollback before prod change.

## Related rules
- Domain, TLS, env vars → `deployment.mdc`. Metrics/alerts → `monitoring.mdc`. Logs → `logging-debug.mdc`.
- Domain, TLS, env vars → `deployment.mdc`. Metric/alert → `monitoring.mdc`. Log → `logging-debug.mdc`.
- Code vs data vs business undo → `backup-rollback.mdc`. 3am auto-mitigate → `incident-automation.mdc`.

## Incidents
- Severity by user impact. Mitigate first, then root-cause. Blameless postmortems with actions.
